811.9;+290,;.01~VA-BL NSG PIV LINES ON ADMISSION
811.9;+290,;1.2~PIV Lines on Admission
811.9;+290,;2~WP-start~5
This reminder defintion will look at the current date and time and 
compare to the admission date and time of an inpatient, it will be DUE 
NOW if the patient is an inpatient and the current fileman date and time 
is less than 25 hours from admission.  It will be resolved if the 
Peripheral IV lines on admission has been addressed.
